        <mxCell id="c108" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Ex 13.3, for fiscal 2026. The matrix has the twelve months and a total on its columns and scrolls sideways; the figure shows 2026-11 and 2026-12. Each promotion is expanded to its start and end dates, which repeat its values. Outlined in coral: the (Blank) row, the lines sold without a promotion, with no discount. Outlined in teal: Harbor Collection Promotion, whose end date precedes its start date. In these months Furniture Seasonal Promotion, which ends 10/31/2026 and Design Trade Customer Promotion, which ends 11/30/2026, carry lines invoiced after their end dates.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="554" width="860" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
